{"id":"pero","lemma":"pero","pos":"conj","rank":23,"glosses":["but","well well; so; well (used for emphasis)","expresses surprise"],"ipa":"/ˈpeɾo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-pero.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sé educada, pero firme.","en":"Be polite, but firm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/721459"},{"text":"Pero no tenía miedo.","en":"But I wasn't afraid.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637190"},{"text":"¡Pero qué absurda idea!","en":"What an absurd idea!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734385"},{"text":"Es duro, pero justo.","en":"It's harsh, but fair.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455386"},{"text":"Es pobre, pero feliz.","en":"He is poor, but happy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637008"}]}